      ms: 3760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1r5tvqc'
    '|b||So offenders shrug at longer sentences but notice police. Doesn''t that sink the rational offender?':
